<view class="settings-page">
  <view class="intro card">
    <text class="intro-icon">🔔</text>
    <view class="intro-text">
      <text class="intro-title">消息提醒设置</text>
      <text class="intro-desc">开启后，每天早上 8 点会按需为你推送提醒</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="settings-group card">
    <view class="setting-item">
      <view class="setting-info">
        <view class="setting-head">
          <text class="setting-icon">🍓</text>
          <text class="setting-title">时令上新提醒</text>
        </view>
        <text class="setting-desc">即将上市、最佳赏味期、即将下市时通知</text>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{seasonal}}" bindchange="onToggleSeasonal" color="#FF6B35" disabled="{{loading}}" />
    </view>

    <view class="setting-divider"></view>

    <view class="setting-item">
      <view class="setting-info">
        <view class="setting-head">
          <text class="setting-icon">⏰</text>
          <text class="setting-title">冰箱临期提醒</text>
        </view>
        <text class="setting-desc">鲜果提前 3 天、冷链熟食提前 5 天、过期当日提醒</text>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{expiry}}" bindchange="onToggleExpiry" color="#FF6B35" disabled="{{loading}}" />
    </view>

    <view class="setting-divider"></view>

    <view class="setting-item">
      <view class="setting-info">
        <view class="setting-head">
          <text class="setting-icon">📦</text>
          <text class="setting-title">囤货过载提醒</text>
        </view>
        <text class="setting-desc">冷藏或保鲜层达到 90% 容量时提醒</text>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{overstock}}" bindchange="onToggleOverstock" color="#FF6B35" disabled="{{loading}}" />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="tips">
    <text class="tips-title">温馨提示</text>
    <text class="tips-line">· 三套提醒相互独立，可单独开关</text>
    <text class="tips-line">· 设置保存后立即生效，无需重复操作</text>
    <text class="tips-line">· 时令提醒优先推送你偏好的品类和家乡美食</text>
  </view>
</view>
